# dialect-en-US.overrides.dict — ADDITIONS to the generated American spelling
# table that VarCon's verified data does not supply.
#
# Read only by dialect-table.py. Same format as ../dialect-en-US.dict:
#
#     <non-target form><TAB><target form>[<TAB>ext-exempt=css,...]
#
# WHY A SECOND HAND-KEPT FILE AND NOT MORE LINES IN ../dialect-en-US.dict.
# That file is read by dialect-guard.sh today, so every line added there also
# changes what today's guard refuses, and the code-check ratchet counts it.
# Step 0 of the auto-fix changes data, not enforcement. When stream B moves the
# guard onto the generated table, the two hand-kept files can be merged.
#
# WHAT BELONGS HERE. A British form that was measured in our own text or in the
# keyed British sample, that the generated table misses, and whose American
# form is not in doubt. Every line was found by measurement
# (richos-hq docs/research/2026-09-27-american-spelling-autofix.md, "Overrides").
#
# THE GENERATOR REFUSES A LINE HERE THAT
#   * VarCon's verified table already carries (then it is not an override),
#   * ../dialect-en-US.dict already carries (one hand-kept source per word),
#   * VarCon marks as a preferred American spelling in some sense (ambiguous),
#   * VarCon maps to a DIFFERENT American form than the one written here.
# VarCon's unverified clusters do carry most of these words, with the same
# American form; the generator checks that agreement rather than trusting it.

# --- unverified in VarCon, measured in the keyed sample -------------------
kerb	curb
kerbs	curbs
kerbside	curbside
skilful	skillful
skilfully	skillfully
skilfulness	skillfulness

# --- measured in our own record ------------------------------------------
onwards	onward

# --- -ise families of words this record and its code produce -------------
anonymise	anonymize
anonymises	anonymizes
anonymised	anonymized
anonymising	anonymizing
anonymisation	anonymization
monetise	monetize
monetises	monetizes
monetised	monetized
monetising	monetizing
tokenise	tokenize
tokenises	tokenizes
tokenised	tokenized
tokenising	tokenizing
tokenisation	tokenization
tokeniser	tokenizer
tokenisers	tokenizers
canonicalise	canonicalize
canonicalises	canonicalizes
canonicalised	canonicalized
canonicalising	canonicalizing
canonicalisation	canonicalization
